                                                                                                "heading":  "Product features",
                                                                                                "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact C-Shaped Design\u003c/strong\u003e: Slides easily under sofas or beds for space-saving use as a snack, laptop, or reading table.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Magazine Pocket\u003c/strong\u003e: Tan leather-like pouch holds magazines, books, remotes, or pens, with V-shaped rack for organized storage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmooth Mobility\u003c/strong\u003e: Four caster wheels (two often lockable) allow effortless repositioning without floor scratches.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Tier Storage\u003c/strong\u003e: Top shelf for drinks/books, lower shelf for magazines, and pocket for small items; load capacity up to 44 lbs on top.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish Office/Waiting Area Fit\u003c/strong\u003e: Pairs with brochures, plants, or decor for lobbies, as seen in hospitality settings.\u003c/p\u003e",
                                                                                                "page":  "product-features"
