                                                                                                      "heading":  "Materials and care",
                                                                                                      "content":  "\u003cp\u003eCrafted from powder-coated metal frame for rust resistance, engineered wood top (often cherry or beech), and faux leather pocket for durability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDaily Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e: Dust with a soft, lint-free microfiber cloth; wipe spills with slightly damp cloth and mild soap, then dry immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePolishing\u003c/strong\u003e: Apply wood-safe polish quarterly in circular motions for shine; avoid excess moisture to prevent warping.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaintenance Tips\u003c/strong\u003e: Keep away from direct sun/heat; lock wheels when stationary; no harsh chemicals or abrasives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
